  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報376期-編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">聽著陳雷sia̋n-pái過身ê消息，hōo lán台語文運動ê有志真m̄甘。伊一世人攑筆寫故鄉台南、二二八、白色恐怖tsia-ê歷史記持，家己mā tsiânn做台語文學ê重要歷史。Tsit期「陳雷記念特集」，有對伊深深ê siàu念。雖然lán lóng ē拄著離別，uân-á ài照起工來行。看〈藏水bī〉ê作者為著研究海洋ê地理，家私tshuân-tsiâu去泅水。Íng過有人趁檨仔tng tio̍h時，tuè厝邊頭尾〈Lo̍k檨仔膏〉，食著有影酸bui甜。M̄-nā人ē歹喙斗，參動物mā ē；原來雞仔tsiânn興〈露螺〉肉tsit味，ná tiô ná啄ê模樣真古錐。Tsit站仔lán tsia̍p拄著〈風颱〉起報頭，來看〈國教院風颱台語講法說明〉，解破翻譯ê理路。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhZwTzTrYt1ZAjeK166dE9IvrmTJYSyX3GrL-nw64nf65jT9reKa8rUgXq72JE1gaiQpua88kgjOGwRJwv2vzcQlqx9B0HPKhyHRWLa0GMZsF7Otv79bQTyMUDyFVJjF7kbQdGix-VLEK8dShwLyZ7XZ8K9ZILUx_0edaMyo79XoQ7POhz1ZdBDkvL95Tt6/s3107/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1376%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3107\" data-original-width=\"2221\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhZwTzTrYt1ZAjeK166dE9IvrmTJYSyX3GrL-nw64nf65jT9reKa8rUgXq72JE1gaiQpua88kgjOGwRJwv2vzcQlqx9B0HPKhyHRWLa0GMZsF7Otv79bQTyMUDyFVJjF7kbQdGix-VLEK8dShwLyZ7XZ8K9ZILUx_0edaMyo79XoQ7POhz1ZdBDkvL95Tt6/w458-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1376%E6%9C%9F_%E7%B7%A8%E8%BC%AF.jpg\" width=\"458\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a name='more'></a><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg7wYqJ3hKj9yoFEzEAEugY-7M2Q7N2SvlVSszSwFECdJVoM5L11lyKk0pgb9eN01ESC74hQ0xqJDasBkQolFCC9